    {
      "title": "Event 3 — Redemption by Cedar Corp.",
      "content": "Cedar has 1,000 shares outstanding, owned by unrelated individuals: Gail 400, Hank 350, Ivy 250. Cedar redeems 200 of Gail's shares."
